# Local dev server

The app runs at http://localhost:3000. One process only.

- Before starting `npm run dev`, check whether port 3000 is already listening. If it is, use that server.
- Do not start a second dev server. Do not switch to port 3001.
- Client page changes reload through the running server. Refresh the browser. Do not restart.
- Restart only when server code changed. Stop the process on port 3000 first, then start one `npm run dev`, and wait until it logs `serving at http://localhost:3000`.
